outres,all,none
outres,nsol,all
outres,rsol,all
outres,eangl,all
outres,veng,all
outres,fflux,all,
outres,cont,all,
cnvtol,heat,,1.e-003,,1.e-003 ! Program Controlled. Set MINREF equivalent of 1e-6 Watts
solve
